  "releaseNotes": "v.1.0.0-preview.71\n- Feature: Added ArrayParameterController for array/list parameter editing in the control panel. Supports string, bool, number, and enum arrays with add/remove/edit UI. (PR #87, contributed by @WimVdSAllPhi)\n- Fix: Fixed a regression where the Actions panel stopped capturing events after switching stories.\n- Fix: Resolved event argument properties being lost in the Actions panel when published as Blazor WebAssembly due to IL trimming.\n\nTo see all the change logs, please visit the following URL.\n- https://github.com/jsakamoto/BlazingStory/blob/main/RELEASE-NOTES.txt",
